# Liliana of the Veil's −6: "Separate all permanents target player controls into two piles. That player sacrifices all
# permanents in the pile of their choice." A pile may be empty (ruling 2022-09-09): Bot1 puts nothing in the first
# pile, so all four of Bot2's permanents are the second, and Bot2 chooses the empty first pile and sacrifices nothing.

